{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"34726763-d907-4cbd-bac7-f3d15c421d1b","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The issue was caused by DynamoDB rejecting `float` values for the **score** field, which led to a `TypeError` and a 500 response on the second publish.  \nThe fix:\n\n* Imported `Decimal` from the standard library.  \n* Converted the similarity score to `Decimal` when building the related‑stories list.\n\nAll changes are saved, and the detailed explanation plus the fix are documented in the artifact:\n\n**[ANSWER.md](file:///Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/34726763-d907-4cbd-bac7-f3d15c421d1b/ANSWER.md)**.\n","duration_seconds":37.407571,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":12804,"output_tokens":2775,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":98944,"total_tokens":15579}}}
